🌐 India &amp; Global InfoSec

🔎 5 Key Cybersecurity Updates

🔹 1. AI Agent Security: Restrict AI permissions and monitor agent activity.

🔹 2. Microsoft Patch Tuesday: Prioritize critical vulnerabilities and verify updates.

🔹 3. BeyondTrust Zero-Day: Patch affected systems and secure remote access.

🔹 4. Magento &amp; Adobe Commerce: Identify vulnerable versions and apply available fixes.

🔹 5. Zero-Click Spyware: Update devices and strengthen endpoint protection.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

🔐 KEY LEARNING
Move from reactive defense to continuous risk reduction.

✅ Patch critical vulnerabilities
✅ Restrict access and privileges
✅ Monitor suspicious activity
✅ Strengthen AI and endpoint security

💬 “Every risk reduced today is an opportunity denied to an attacker tomorrow.”

